1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 18=

2
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:10,620
Mr. Zhao.

3
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:13,700
Mr. Ding.

4
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:14,500
Mr. Zhao.

5
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:17,180
This is Mr. Jing from
the Kun Society's Cishan Foundation.

6
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:18,380
He's also Boss Ren's adopted son.

7
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:20,260
He's here on Boss Ren's
behalf to have a look around.

8
00:01:20,740 --> 00:01:22,380
It's an honor to meet you!

9
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:23,180
Boss Jing.

10
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:26,060
Which part would you like to see?

11
00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:28,220
Our procession for the Sanxun Gathering

12
00:01:28,420 --> 00:01:30,020
is mainly responsible for...

13
00:01:30,180 --> 00:01:32,060
Which part was Young Master Kuang
responsible for?

14
00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:35,300
The young master?

15
00:01:36,580 --> 00:01:37,860
Boss Ren was deeply saddened

16
00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:39,180
to hear what happened
to the young master.

17
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:41,140
After speaking with Mrs. Kuang,

18
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:42,540
we've decided to organize

19
00:01:42,620 --> 00:01:43,580
a charity exhibition

20
00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:45,220
in Young Master Kuang's honor

21
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:47,180
to showcase his work and craftsmanship

22
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:48,540
for everyone to see.

23
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:50,940
That's a wonderful idea.

24
00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:53,620
The young master loved
painting since childhood.

25
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:55,540
If it hadn't been for those criminals,

26
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:57,900
he might have become
a great painter someday.

27
00:01:58,020 --> 00:01:58,660
He

28
00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:00,420
often painted in this room.

29
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:01,660
Let me show you around.

30
00:02:01,660 --> 00:02:02,620
Come on, let's go.

31
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:07,020
Watch your step.

32
00:02:23,820 --> 00:02:27,380
The young master came
to help almost every day.

33
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:28,860
Whenever he came,

34
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:30,580
he'd shut himself in this room

35
00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:32,460
and wouldn't leave until late.

36
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:33,220
Mr. Zhao.

37
00:02:33,780 --> 00:02:35,820
We'll stay here with Mr. Jing.

38
00:02:35,820 --> 00:02:36,780
You can get back to work.

39
00:02:36,860 --> 00:02:38,420
All right, I'll get back to work.

40
00:02:38,420 --> 00:02:39,740
Call me if you need anything.

41
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:42,900
I'll get everyone some tea.

42
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:44,820
Thank you. All right.

43
00:03:11,820 --> 00:03:12,700
Look over here.

44
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:20,340
This is...

45
00:03:23,420 --> 00:03:25,060
So this is where he put on makeup

46
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:26,060
and changed clothes,

47
00:03:26,420 --> 00:03:28,380
then climbed out
the window to meet Xiaozhu.

48
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:29,660
In the evenings,

49
00:03:29,660 --> 00:03:31,700
he'd remove his makeup
and wash up at the hot water shop,

50
00:03:31,700 --> 00:03:33,540
then come back and hide everything here.

51
00:03:39,220 --> 00:03:40,020
Black cat.

52
00:03:40,580 --> 00:03:41,860
There seems to be something else inside.

53
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:43,500
This is...

54
00:03:43,980 --> 00:03:45,020
Xiaozhu's diary.

55
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:45,740
Huh?

56
00:03:45,820 --> 00:03:47,220
I searched everywhere
at home but couldn't find it.

57
00:03:47,660 --> 00:03:48,860
Quick, open it.

58
00:03:50,780 --> 00:03:51,500
This is...

59
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:52,500
Isn't this the notebook

60
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:53,940
we found at the hot water shop?

61
00:04:05,420 --> 00:04:06,260
Mr. Jing.

62
00:04:06,460 --> 00:04:07,900
What's wrong with Mr. Ding?

63
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:09,780
Ding Yiyi is on the list too.

64
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:11,460
She was treated as a Black Cat

65
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:12,860
and offered

66
00:04:13,180 --> 00:04:14,380
to Kuang Jinpeng.

67
00:04:16,780 --> 00:04:18,620
(Ding Yiyi, Kuang Jinpeng)

68
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:20,220
Ding Zhao, calm down.

69
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:20,980
If you act now,

70
00:04:20,980 --> 00:04:21,700
you won't be getting revenge.

71
00:04:21,700 --> 00:04:22,660
You'll only get yourself killed.

72
00:04:22,660 --> 00:04:23,620
So what?

73
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:24,980
Then we'll die together.

74
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,040
Didn't we agree

75
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,640
to bring them all down?

76
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:32,440
Kuang Jinpeng isn't our only enemy.

77
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,240
It's the organization behind him

78
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,920
and every criminal who has harmed women.

79
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,360
If you kill him now,

80
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:39,700
Yiyi, who doesn't know
the truth, will only resent you,

81
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:41,120
and the Kun Society will have
an excuse to eliminate you.

82
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:41,960
What good will that do?

83
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:44,040
Then I'll do what you did
when you tried to kill Lv Mengde.

84
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:44,840
Once he's dead,

85
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:45,880
you can publish the story

86
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,880
and expose his crimes

87
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:50,080
so he'll never get
a chance to defend himself.

88
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,640
That's not enough.

89
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:53,080
Letting them die just like that

90
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,120
would be far too merciful.

91
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:56,360
We need to make them

92
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,720
watch their own reputations crumble,

93
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,640
watch all the wealth

94
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:02,440
and status they've built vanish,

95
00:05:02,440 --> 00:05:04,120
as the world condemns and despises them,

96
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,120
leaving them disgraced for generations.

97
00:05:06,300 --> 00:05:07,280
Only then

98
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:10,320
will they get
the punishment they deserve

99
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,400
and serve as a warning to others,

100
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,120
so no one dares to abuse
the vulnerable so easily.

101
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,520
Only then can we say

102
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,840
we've truly obtained justice.

103
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:36,160
Don't worry.

104
00:05:37,550 --> 00:05:39,400
The day they finally pay
for their crimes

105
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,000
is almost here.

106
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:06,760
I'm sorry.

107
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,200
I got you into trouble.

108
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:11,760
I wanted to make that call myself.

109
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,520
You were right.

110
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,800
I need to think about my future.

111
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,840
I want to leave.

112
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,560
I want justice for what happened to me.

113
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,920
Who are you calling?

114
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:32,280
I'm trying to reach Mengde.

115
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,360
I'm calling him.

116
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:38,440
Why are you looking for him?

117
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:41,160
You should come to me.

118
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,080
I'm the one you should be turning to!

119
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,640
Master Kuang, what are you doing?

120
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:50,320
You can't count on Mengde anymore.

121
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:52,080
Whether he's dead or alive,

122
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:54,840
he'll never marry you.

123
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:55,680
Do you understand?

124
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:56,920
What do you mean?

125
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:58,600
What happened to Mengde?

126
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,480
What happened to him?

127
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,520
Nothing happened to him.

128
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:01,800
But you,

129
00:07:03,120 --> 00:07:05,600
and the child you're carrying...

130
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:09,000
It's been over two months now.

131
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:16,680
Have you forgotten?

132
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,920
It was Mengde who...

133
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,380
Let go of me!

134
00:07:19,380 --> 00:07:20,920
Branded you as a Black Cat

135
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,160
and offered you to me.

136
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,800
Mengde.

137
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:25,920
I can't do it.

138
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,040
I can't.

139
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,320
Yiyi.

140
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:30,160
You can do it. You can.

141
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,120
I'm scared.

142
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,240
Just this once.

143
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,920
I really need his help.

144
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,360
Please?

145
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,200
I promise

146
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,440
I'll marry you.

147
00:07:41,040 --> 00:07:42,360
I'll spend my whole life
making it up to you.

148
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:43,280
All right?

149
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:47,520
Just pretend he's me.

150
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,040
It'll be quick.

151
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:51,920
Very quick.

152
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:53,160
I'll wait outside.

153
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:55,920
Mengde.

154
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,160
That's not how it happened!

155
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,560
I need to find Mengde!

156
00:08:05,820 --> 00:08:07,440
- I need to find Mengde!
- You're not going anywhere!

157
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:09,160
You must give birth to this child!

158
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,160
Only when the child is born

159
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,880
can this family's fortunes turn around.

160
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:15,200
You must give birth to this child!

161
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:16,520
I need to find him!

162
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,400
What are you trying to do?

163
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,320
I'm here to help you.

164
00:08:34,760 --> 00:08:35,800
Xiaozhu's secret

165
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,400
should be yours to reveal.

166
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,560
The last entry was written for Yijie.

167
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:00,720
What's wrong?

168
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:02,160
Xiaozhu...

169
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:03,720
What did she say?

170
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,400
She said

171
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,480
her death

172
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:12,000
was neither murder nor an accident.

173
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:12,760
Instead,

174
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:18,880
she willingly

175
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:21,160
chose to take her own life.

176
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:25,880
Miss Mei.

177
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:50,320
(May 9, a sunny day.)

178
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:52,960
(That was the first time
I noticed Kuang Yijie.)

179
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:56,360
(Several boys were
bullying him at school.)

180
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,640
Get lost! Who are you?

181
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,920
You're the one leading the bullying.

182
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,400
I'm reporting you to the principal!

183
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,720
Do you know who I am?

184
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,560
Kong Jiahao.

185
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,160
Isn't your father promoting

186
00:10:07,160 --> 00:10:08,400
the New Life Movement?

187
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:09,640
Teaching everyone to be civilized

188
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:10,520
and uphold moral values?

189
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:11,880
What you're doing isn't civilized

190
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:12,760
or moral at all.

191
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:15,320
If you ever bully another student,

192
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:16,760
I'll report everything you've done

193
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,320
to Director Kong

194
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,200
so he can see how his precious son

195
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,880
is undermining his work.

196
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,320
Crazy girl! Let's go.

197
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:30,240
Take off your clothes.

198
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,240
You'll catch a cold.

199
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:34,360
Take them off.

200
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,480
Hurry up.

201
00:10:57,800 --> 00:10:59,040
Let me help you.

202
00:11:15,040 --> 00:11:15,880
Stay away from me.

203
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:33,080
They told me I got this scar
when I was little.

204
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:34,960
A scar from an injury?

205
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,320
How could our scars be exactly the same?

206
00:11:44,840 --> 00:11:46,000
When school first started,

207
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,040
I thought you looked familiar.

208
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:52,800
Don't you think

209
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:54,880
we look a little alike?

210
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,960
(Later, Kuang Yijie went to ask)

211
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,760
(a former servant of the Kuang family.)

212
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:03,000
(That's how he learned
he really did have a younger sister.)

213
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:04,720
(But after she was born,)

214
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,440
(she was never brought back
to the Kuang residence.)

215
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:09,400
(As for me, I never imagined)

216
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:11,480
(I'd suddenly have an older brother.)

217
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:12,360
Xiaozhu.

218
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:13,800
What is it?

219
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,280
Come with me after school.

220
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:17,240
Where are we going?

221
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,480
Come home with me.

222
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,480
What for?

223
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:24,080
To reunite with your family?

224
00:12:24,520 --> 00:12:25,400
There's really no need.

225
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,400
I have a sister.

226
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,040
She raised me.

227
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:29,640
I'm all she has,

228
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:31,480
and she's all I have.

229
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,520
But...

230
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,120
Have you forgotten

231
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,360
what that old servant told you?

232
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,640
He said I was unlucky.

233
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,640
Your own father

234
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,960
and grandfather abandoned me.

235
00:12:40,530 --> 00:12:42,560
They abandoned me sixteen years ago.

236
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,960
How could I possibly go back now?

237
00:12:47,760 --> 00:12:49,040
Then can we be friends?

238
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:57,320
Of course.

239
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,720
(But I never expected)

240
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:01,520
(that the man Yiyi had fallen for)

241
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:03,600
(was also connected
to the Kuang family.)

242
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:04,360
Xiaozhu.

243
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:05,760
Yiyi.

244
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:07,480
What brings you here?

245
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:08,760
Guess what?

246
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,480
That gentleman I told you about

247
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,840
has asked to meet me.

248
00:13:12,200 --> 00:13:13,760
The one who held an umbrella
over you in the rain

249
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:15,120
and walked you home?

250
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,120
Yes, that's him.

251
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:17,480
He's a very influential man,

252
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:19,040
someone really important.

253
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:20,800
And he's so gentle with me.

254
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,120
But...

255
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,920
Are you sure you want to meet him?

256
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:24,920
Yes.

257
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:26,920
Xiaozhu.

258
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,920
Could I secretly borrow

259
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:30,800
one of the beautiful
dresses your sister made?

260
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:34,040
This really means a lot to me.

261
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:36,320
All right.

262
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:37,520
Really?

263
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:38,400
Sure.

264
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:40,080
I knew you were the best!

265
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:45,240
(Yiyi said I was her only friend.)

266
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:46,840
(She had no one else to turn to,)

267
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,360
(so she came to me for help.)

268
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,800
You meet him every Monday.

269
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:55,480
Aren't you worried
it'll affect your studies?

270
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:57,880
We study to secure a good future.

271
00:13:58,160 --> 00:13:59,600
If I marry a wealthy man,

272
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:01,080
that's a good future too.

273
00:14:01,760 --> 00:14:02,680
That's not the same.

274
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:03,840
We should rely on ourselves.

275
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:06,760
Xiaozhu.

276
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:09,240
Nobody can rely entirely on themselves.

277
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:11,920
We depend on our families
for food and education.

278
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:13,040
When we grow up and find jobs,

279
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:13,880
we depend on our employers.

280
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:16,200
We trade our time and skills for money.

281
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:20,200
So isn't a husband
just like an employer?

282
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:21,840
Besides,

283
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,840
with a husband, there's love too.

284
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:25,760
That's ridiculous reasoning.

285
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,520
You just don't understand love.

286
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:31,160
One day,

287
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,440
when you meet someone you understand

288
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,920
and who understands you too,

289
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:36,240
you'll realize

290
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:39,880
how rare something like that is.

291
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:50,360
Then show me what your love looks like.

292
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:53,840
Gladly!

293
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:56,000
I've been wanting to take you there.

294
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:57,160
You know what?

295
00:14:57,560 --> 00:14:58,480
Only there

296
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:01,040
can you experience
the true beauty of Shanghai.

297
00:15:01,760 --> 00:15:03,680
It's not all gray and drenched in sweat.

298
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:05,880
It's a dazzling world of colors,

299
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:10,320
so beautiful you feel
like you're stepping into a dream.

300
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,120
Hey, slow down!

301
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:13,200
Watch out, or you'll fall!

302
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,400
What happened after that?

303
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,680
What exactly happened between you two?

304
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:27,400
How much of what you said
in church was true?

305
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:28,280
How much was false?

306
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,600
How much was said under pressure?

307
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,760
And how much was an accusation?

308
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,600
I don't know.

309
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:41,160
At the beginning,

310
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,640
I was so full of joy.

311
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:46,720
I thought

312
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:50,280
I could live the life I wanted

313
00:15:51,240 --> 00:15:53,160
and have a bright future.

314
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:11,280
(Kaimeili)

315
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:12,160
(Why would she arrange to meet)

316
00:16:12,160 --> 00:16:13,400
(in a place like this?)

317
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:17,000
(Could she be dazzled
by all this glamour?)

318
00:16:18,420 --> 00:16:20,190
(Could someone deceive her)

319
00:16:20,610 --> 00:16:21,400
(or hurt her?)

320
00:16:24,160 --> 00:16:25,480
But Xiaozhu didn't know

321
00:16:26,020 --> 00:16:27,740
I'd taken her there on purpose.

322
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:35,840
Mengde always said I had no friends,

323
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:38,080
that I wasn't like other girls

324
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:40,160
who always went out together in groups.

325
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,120
Like Lisa.

326
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:45,000
Lisa was a good example.

327
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:47,320
She always brought
her girlfriends along.

328
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:51,160
Mengde and Boss Long Feng
both liked her.

329
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:54,640
(That was my first time going
to Kaimeili with Yiyi.)

330
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:58,240
(The men there were
like vicious predators.)

331
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:00,520
- (Girls were treated as prey,)
- Who is she?

332
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:02,080
- (waiting to be devoured.)
- Doesn't matter.

333
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,400
So, what do you think of this place?

334
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:05,920
Boss Liu, Boss Dong.

335
00:17:06,360 --> 00:17:07,120
Long time no see.

336
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:08,960
We just saw each other yesterday.

337
00:17:09,320 --> 00:17:09,680
Have a seat.

338
00:17:10,360 --> 00:17:11,200
Get me a drink.

339
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,640
Pick whatever you like. It's on me.

340
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:14,560
Miss,

341
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:15,760
may I buy you a drink?

342
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,920
I don't drink.

343
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,000
Just one glass.

344
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,760
Can't you do me that favor?

345
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:20,760
That's right.

346
00:17:21,280 --> 00:17:21,880
You're already here.

347
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:22,720
Have a little.

348
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:24,000
- Have a drink.
- Just one.

349
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:25,340
- I don't want to.
- Come on, one drink.

350
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:28,080
Just do me this favor.

351
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:29,000
Let's go.

352
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:29,900
Hey!

353
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:32,600
It's the young lady's first time here.

354
00:17:32,910 --> 00:17:34,640
Why are you all giving
her such a hard time?

355
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:38,520
Boss Lv.

356
00:17:38,540 --> 00:17:39,160
- Boss Lv.
- Boss Lv.

357
00:17:39,420 --> 00:17:40,520
Wouldn't it be a greater honor

358
00:17:40,520 --> 00:17:41,640
if our star performer Lisa

359
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:42,880
had a drink with you instead?

360
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:44,840
That would be a real honor!

361
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:48,960
Yiyi, who's this?

362
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:52,240
This is the friend I told you about,

363
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:52,920
my very best friend,

364
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:53,720
Mei Xiaozhu.

365
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:54,600
Xiaozhu, this is...

366
00:17:54,600 --> 00:17:56,320
Hello, I'm Lv Mengde.

367
00:18:03,300 --> 00:18:05,550
Are you also a student
at Mintong Middle School, Miss Mei?

368
00:18:05,550 --> 00:18:08,500
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

369
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:11,800
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

370
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:13,760
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

371
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:15,320
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

372
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:17,280
♪But I refuse to fall♪

373
00:18:17,280 --> 00:18:22,320
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

374
00:18:22,320 --> 00:18:24,800
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

375
00:18:25,840 --> 00:18:28,800
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

376
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:32,080
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

377
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:35,000
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

378
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:38,440
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

379
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:41,840
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

380
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:45,760
♪Those who have hurt me♪

381
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:49,080
♪I choose to pierce through♪

382
00:18:50,760 --> 00:18:52,240
♪To tear apart♪

383
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:58,320
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

384
00:18:59,880 --> 00:19:01,880
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

385
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:04,880
♪Nor bow to power♪

386
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:07,320
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

387
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:12,760
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
